Operator: stage the full corpus so the predictor has real data. The .416 A2 'corpus shortfall' was the
HF parquet MIRROR being truncated to 10,000. Downloaded the full per-game raw replays (Kaggle mirror
jihangli1121/arc-agi-3-replays-v1, CC BY 4.0), adapted the {timestamp,data} event format into the corpus
module's trajectory rows, and re-staged with NO cap -> 14,797 examples (4 shards, all human steps x 25
games; 97% frame-changed; 14,020 normalize to a valid action_id; behavior/imitation prior builds OK).
Corpus is gitignored (643M, local training only, attribution required, NOT bundled into any submission).
.417 A2 (re-train predictor) + A3 (imitation prior) now run on full/real data. Temp download cleaned.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
